@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
hide footbox
actor "Mission Operator" as O
control "FastAPI" as API
control "Mission runner" as R
participant "Simulation adapter\nPX4 / Gazebo" as SIM
database "Store" as DB
O -> API : Explicit start of READY mission
API -> DB : Lock mission and vehicle lease;\nrecheck access and geometry
alt Vehicle reserved / checks fail
  API --> O : Reject start
else Start accepted
  API -> DB : Reserve selected UAV; set STARTING_SIMULATION
  API -> R : Schedule one runner
  API --> O : Start accepted (202)
  R -> SIM : Start selected model and mission-local origin
  SIM -> SIM : Set Gazebo geographic origin near first waypoint;\nstart simulator; no flight command
  R -> DB : Set WAITING_FOR_VEHICLE
  loop Wait for connection readiness (up to 120 s)
    R -> SIM : Read status
    SIM --> R : Process alive; heartbeat and position < 4 s
  end
  R -> DB : Set UPLOADING
  R -> SIM : Upload validated plan
  SIM -> SIM : Upload route with final return-to-launch item
  R -> SIM : Explicit mission start
  SIM -> SIM : Wait for fresh pre-arm health (up to 30 s)
  SIM -> SIM : Arm; start mission
  R -> DB : Set EXECUTING
  loop Until terminal outcome or runner failure
    R -> SIM : Read vehicle snapshot
    SIM --> R : Readiness, armed flag and mission progress
    R -> DB : Store telemetry; process selected fixtures
  end
  alt Runner failure at startup or execution
    R -> SIM : Attempt runtime stop
    R -> DB : Record FAILED and retained error;\nsave snapshot and release reservation
  else Armed-to-disarmed outcome
    R -> DB : Record COMPLETED / CANCELLED / INTERRUPTED;\nsave snapshot and release reservation
  end
end
note over API, DB
  Authenticated mission snapshots: WebSocket every 2 s.
  Web interface also polls selected mission every 5 s.
  Completion: armed then disarmed, not CANCELLING,
  reached >= total - 2. Cancellation resolves to CANCELLED.
end note
note over R, SIM
  Runner error: attempt runtime stop, record FAILED with error,
  preserve coverage and release the lease. Startup/restart never
  automatically resumes an unfinished flight. FR-28–FR-46.
end note
@enduml
